body:
Quick pass done on 8b850a18.
- Merges cleanly with main: upstream main is unchanged since the branch merged it, and a trial merge is clean.
- Gates on this head: `cargo test -p camcraft-ui` (CWD `crates/ui`) all green, 596 lib tests plus every integration binary. App `setup_wcs`, `setup_sheet`, `rotated_wcs`, `setup_align`, `program_entry`, `inverted_axis_display`, `setup_stock_source` and `--lib setup_origin` pass. `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings` is clean. Pinning tests are named in the body.
- The body is complete: what changed, how it was tested, what was not exercised, `Changelog:`, `Fixes #870`.
- Laws:
  - no `unwrap`/`expect`/`panic!` outside tests;
  - no snapshot PNG touched;
  - the new files are under 400 lines (118 / 60 / 89), each with its provenance line;
  - a decision file is included;
  - no process files, dependencies or `build.rs` changed.
  - `pages.rs` was already over 400 lines; this PR nets about +5 lines there and puts its new code in its own files.
- It's a `feat`, so it merges at the next cut. Overlap with #759 is described in the body.

Flagging ready for review.
